Bharata views Ārya-filled assembly like full moon --- Vasiṣṭha urges Bharata to enjoy given thornless kingdom --- Tear-choked Bharata blames priest refusing theft --- Bharata declares eldest Rāma alone deserves kingdom --- Bharata disowns mother sin bowing to forest Rāma --- Bharata vows forest dwelling like Lakṣmaṇa if Rāma stays --- Bharata orders Sumantra to muster army for march --- Delighted chiefs and wives hasten warriors to march --- All castes yoke camels donkeys elephants and horses
